('ffbe3808-003e-525b-a3e4-5004ede21c28', '19b57acf-37de-56ab-97d6-e997cb0da0f0', 'As the capacitor''s p.d. rises, the p.d. across the resistor falls, so the current falls', 'A', true, 0),
('2b5ec460-fe38-557d-a7a9-bfe4948c0a5a', '19b57acf-37de-56ab-97d6-e997cb0da0f0', 'The battery runs down', 'B', false, 1),
('be576608-5858-5b6a-8536-b4f23fe76693', '19b57acf-37de-56ab-97d6-e997cb0da0f0', 'The resistor heats up and its resistance rises', 'C', false, 2),
